    "created_at": "2023-03-24T15:52:15Z",
    "updated_at": "2023-03-24T15:52:15Z",
    "body": "As I said on Twitter, it's explained by the note this PR added. `Set-Cookie` is the only header that cannot be combined (in the HTTP sense) and we don't want implementations to have to support that for requests as it would require a special side table in optimized implementations.",
    "author_association": "MEMBER",
